hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1092","Chapter on burning date-palms, 1130 - Abu Sa'id al-Ashajj narrated to us, he said: Uqbah, meaning Ibn Khalid, narrated to us, he said: Ubayd Allah narrated to us, he said: Nafi' narrated to me, from Ibn Umar (may Allah be pleased with them), that the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) burned the date-palms of Banu al-Nadir."
